OL,3,GNEWSAProjectionist's Hollywood poster
OL,4,Acollection for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a cinema projectionist
OL,7,Fwho saved Hollywood posters for 40
OL,8,Fyears has put his collection up for
OL,9,Fauction.
OL,11,FRobin Langford kept almost 100 artworks
OL,12,Ffrom the films he showed, featuring
OL,13,Fstars including Clint Eastwood, Audrey
OL,14,FHepburn and Raquel Welch.
OL,16,FThe collection is expected to fetch
OL,17,Fabout #35,000 when it goes under the
OL,18,Fhammer at Ewbank's auction house in
OL,19,FWoking, Surrey on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
